      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a natural inclination to seek an end when the struggle feels endless, and the quiet of the mist can seem like a perfect, gentle conclusion. That sense of inevitability you feel is a heavy burden, suggesting that the effort of staying is more exhausting than the thought of letting go. Please consider that even if the current chapter feels final, there are other narratives waiting to be written, even small ones. Reaching out to a professional can help you find a different ending to this particular story.",
